agents-orchestrator branch secrets-vault-s2 (T-72 S2, unreleased), /agent/v1 paths only (method + operationId). Edited by hand from the v6.8.0 fixture because the orchestrator side is not released yet: the secret PUT route (/agent/v1/admin/presets/{ref}/secrets/{name}) is removed and /agent/v1/admin/vault (GET) and /agent/v1/admin/presets/{ref}/vault/{entry_id} (PUT, DELETE) are added. Replace by a re-vendored filter of the released openapi.json (for each path starting with /agent/v1 write {"paths": {path: {method: {"operationId": id}}}} with sorted keys and indent 1) once the orchestrator releases 7.0.0.
